1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,752
Narrator: Bunny and the Magic Rainbow!

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,490
Narrator: In the Colorful Forest, a little bunny named Bobo wakes up.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,213
Bobo: Good morning, sun! Good morning, rainbow!

4
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,110
Bobo: Oh no! The rainbow lost its colors!

5
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,492
Bobo: I will find them!

6
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,727
Mimi: Bobo! Wait for me!

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,566
Mimi: Hee hee! Hi, Bobo!

8
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,978
Bobo: Hi, Mimi! Let's find the colors together!

9
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,406
Mimi: Yay! Together!

10
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,796
Pip: Tweet! My kite is stuck in the tree!

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,435
Mimi: Hop up, Bobo!

12
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:37,608
Pip: Thank you, friends!

13
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,524
Bobo: Red and orange!

14
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:44,398
Bizzy: Bzz! Hello! My sunflowers are thirsty!

15
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,110
Mimi: I have water!

16
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:47,400
Bobo: Let's help!

17
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,287
Bizzy: Hooray! Thank you!

18
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:58,487
Narrator: Yellow is back! Helping makes everyone smile.

19
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:03,099
Hoppy: Ribbit! Can you hop like me?

20
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,708
Bobo: Yes! Let's count!

21
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,200
Bobo: One!

22
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,400
Bobo: Two!

23
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,600
Bobo: Three!

24
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,695
Mimi: My turn!

25
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,323
Mimi: Hee hee! I'm a splashy bear!

26
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,322
Hoppy: Green and blue! Hooray!

27
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,353
Narrator: Laughing with friends is fun!

28
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:24,029
Nutty: Oopsie! My berries!

29
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,290
Bobo: We can help! Let's count them!

30
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,800
Mimi: One!

31
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:29,800
Bobo: Two!

32
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:30,800
Mimi: Three!

33
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:31,800
Bobo: Four!

34
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:32,800
Bobo & Mimi: Five!

35
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,985
Nutty: Thank you! You are so kind!

36
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,980
Bobo: We found all the colors! Let's go!

37
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:44,831
Bobo: Everyone, let's do it together!

38
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:49,146
Everyone: One, two, three... Rainbow!

39
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:55,228
Narrator: When we help our friends, the whole world gets brighter!

40
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,032
Bobo & Mimi: Bye-bye, friends!

